  "goodToKnow": "Mitnichten means by no means or not at all, a formal, slightly old-fashioned negation used for emphasis: Das ist mitnichten so einfach. Journalists like it for contradicting a claim. Everyday synonyms: keineswegs, auf keinen Fall, gar nicht. It comes from an old phrase meaning with nothing. Its opposite in tone is mitunter (sometimes), which is unrelated."
